# Synthesizability benchmark: downloaded/preprocessed datasets and any
# generated output that reproduces raw SMILES are never committed —
# regenerated by benchmarks/synthesizability/scripts/download_brsascore.py
# and the run_*.py scripts; see benchmarks/synthesizability/datasets/README.md
# for licensing/provenance. Aggregate result files with no raw SMILES
# (benchmark_summary.json, selective_prediction.csv, timing.json) ARE
# committed, as evidence, not regenerated silently.
benchmarks/synthesizability/datasets/downloaded/
benchmarks/synthesizability/results/raw/
benchmarks/synthesizability/results/per_molecule.jsonl

